      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Near Dilley, Texas, our agents intercepted a failed human smuggling attempt where seven illegal aliens were discovered crammed inside a locked tanker. After stopping the vehicle, agents noticed the tanker was locked. Agents used an axe to break the lock and free the smuggled aliens trapped inside. Thankfully, no one was injured. The driver, a U.S. citizen, was arrested and faces prosecution under 8 USC § 1324 (human smuggling).\n\nThis is another example of smugglers’ complete disregard for human life, valuing profit over everything, putting lives at risk.",
      "text_resolved": "Near Dilley, Texas, our agents intercepted a failed human smuggling attempt where seven illegal aliens were discovered crammed inside a locked tanker. After stopping the vehicle, agents noticed the tanker was locked. Agents used an axe to break the lock and free the smuggled aliens trapped inside. Thankfully, no one was injured. The driver, a U.S. citizen, was arrested and faces prosecution under 8 USC § 1324 (human smuggling).\n\nThis is another example of smugglers’ complete disregard for human life, valuing profit over everything, putting lives at risk.",
