      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Last night, Department of Defense aircraft repatriated illegal aliens who recently crossed the U.S.-Mexico border back to Guatemala. This level of support from the U.S. military is unprecedented. DoD is providing critical and much needed assistance to the men and women of the United States Border Patrol. For the first time, we’re seeing a true whole-of-government approach take shape, as our country leverages every available resource to secure our borders. This is what collaboration looks like, and it’s making a difference.",
      "text_resolved": "Last night, Department of Defense aircraft repatriated illegal aliens who recently crossed the U.S.-Mexico border back to Guatemala. This level of support from the U.S. military is unprecedented. DoD is providing critical and much needed assistance to the men and women of the United States Border Patrol. For the first time, we’re seeing a true whole-of-government approach take shape, as our country leverages every available resource to secure our borders. This is what collaboration looks like, and it’s making a difference.",
